window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Get three hot tiger shifter romance books in one incredible box set and step into the Eternal Mates world from</b><b><i> New York Times</i></b><b> and </b><b><i>USA Today </i></b><b>best-selling paranormal romance author Felicity Heaton.</b></p> <p>The Tiger Mates bundle features sizzling passion, fated mates, sexy shifters, protective heroes, and strong heroines — an explosive combination sure to have you falling in love with the rich, detailed, and addictive world of the Eternal Mates series.</p> <p>Listen to the tales of three sibling shifters as they find their true mates and battle to win their hearts, and their happily forever after.</p> <p><b>Books included in this shifter romance box set:</b></p> <ul> <li><i>Turned by a Tiger </i></li> <li><i>Tamed by a Tiger </i></li> <li><i>Treasured by a Tiger </i></li> </ul>"; 
